{"base":"f7a4921ae7da4a033284005220f349b33fe240c8","description":"build: add make changelog target\n\n- Wrap `git cliff --unreleased --prepend CHANGELOG.md` as a Make target\n  so starting a new release cycle is one memorable command.\n- Update RELEASE.md to use `make changelog` and keep opening `$EDITOR`\n  as an explicit separate step.\n\nWhy: the cliff invocation is the one command in the release flow that\nisn't run often enough to memorize, and putting it behind a target\ngives the changelog step a canonical entry point without hiding the\nsubsequent manual prose editing.","oid":"94857a22d0acc4cc4fea444492095855509cb1be","type":"revision"}